On 29 October, starting at 13:00 UTC, our renewal charge ran twice. 1,912 of our subscribers were charged twice for the same month. That was our mistake, and we're sorry. You trusted us with your card and we took money we weren't owed.

It came from our own renewal job. There is no sign of outside access to payment details. {{why_the_job_ran_twice}}

We stopped the duplicate run at 14:05 UTC, and nothing has been charged twice since. Every duplicate charge will be refunded in full. Refunds are issued on {{refund_issue_date}} and banks usually show them within {{bank_days}}. You don't need to do anything.

{{bank_fee_policy}}

To stop this happening again, {{what_changes}}.

Questions: reply to our email, or write to support@brewvane.example. Next update by {{next_update_time}} at brewvane.example/update.
